@startuml ApplicationStateDiagram

title ITJobs - Estados de Postulacion

[*] --> PENDING

PENDING --> REVIEWED : reclutador revisa
REVIEWED --> ACCEPTED : reclutador acepta
REVIEWED --> REJECTED : reclutador rechaza
PENDING --> WITHDRAWN : candidato retira
REVIEWED --> WITHDRAWN : candidato retira

ACCEPTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
WITHDRAWN --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  Estado inicial.
  Esperando revision.
end note

note right of ACCEPTED
  Candidato seleccionado.
  Notificar al candidato.
end note

note right of WITHDRAWN
  El candidato cancelo
  su postulacion.
end note

@enduml
